      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROOM TO BREATHE (4) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (27.47) at Horsham behind Crackerjack Ralf in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Boasts two wins from two starts out of this box. Sure to be about the mark. MEPUNGA BROCKIE (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (22.92) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Should be about the money. ONE MORE BUTTON (3) scored (17.36) last time out at Mt Gambier adding to an already respectable career. Has a good record at this journey. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Bold showing expected again. PAW EDEN (2) should be thereabouts.",
